      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "As per the complaint, the marriage was solemnized in Patna High Court CR. MISC. No.13129 of 2018(2) dt.19-01-2023 the year 2001with Ramjeet Mallah for which dowry was also given but later she was being regularly tortured and in the process assaulted.",
